  description: 'Effect: Has no special abilities. Relies strictly on pure deduction
    and voting in the Sacrifice Phase to root out the evil.'
  curDescription: 'Effect: [Active] Infects the nearest uninfected card in one of
    four directions (Up, Down, Left, Right).'
  infectedDescription: 'Effect: [Status] The plague''s mark is upon you. Beware the
    Villagers'' scrutiny (check); from this moment on, to be discovered is to welcome
    the cold, silent embrace of death.'
  curInfectedDescription: 'Effect: [Active] Infects an enemy. Your shadows can no
    longer hide the rot. Guard yourself against the villagers'' gaze (check); discovery
    is now a one-way path to the executioner''s blade.'
  cardSkill: {fileID: 0}
  quotes:
  - I'm just a simple villager, I swear!
  - Don't look at me like that... I'm scared.
  - Did you hear that noise coming from the seat next to me?
  - It's getting so cold in here... is someone watching us?
